  q_0.80(|T|) = q_0.900(T): simulated 3.876 | KVB(2000)/LLSS Table 2: 3.890
  q_0.90(|T|) = q_0.950(T): simulated 5.323 | KVB(2000)/LLSS Table 2: 5.374
  q_0.95(|T|) = q_0.975(T): simulated 6.746 | KVB(2000)/LLSS Table 2: 6.811
  q_0.98(|T|) = q_0.990(T): simulated 8.608 | KVB(2000)/LLSS Table 2: 8.544

  two-sided 95% critical value = q_0.95(|T|) = q_0.975(T): simulated 6.746, published 6.811; we use the published value (6.811), which is the more conservative of the two.
